	MH_anchor = "Follows the anchor ship when there is no work; gives Mine/Loot a work area around the anchor."
	MH_avoid = "Routes every leg around enemy weapon ranges and steps out when caught inside (emergency)."
	MH_build = "Construction and replacement of ships (phase 5)."
	MH_crew = "Crew redistribution and capped hiring (phase 3)."
	MH_defend = "Without Guard: an enemy within weapons range is shot at without changing course, or escaped from on the escape arc (emergency)."
	MH_guard = "Attacks the nearest enemy on radar, then resumes after the delay."
	MH_hunt = "Seeks out enemies inside its area (work zone, or range around the anchor) and attacks them; past 1.5x the radius flies back first."
	MH_loot = "Collects derelict wrecks, storage caches, abandoned ships (salvaged, not captured) and loose resources."
	MH_mine = "Mines asteroids, including rocks still in stasis."
	MH_offload = "Flies to the offload target at the threshold and unloads; parks there when idle."
	MH_production = "Switches this ship's factories off when their product reaches its 'At most' (Profiles, Surplus) and back on below it; products without 'At most' are left alone."
	ProdCappedByKeep = "{0}: the keep-aboard amount stops the factory before 'At most'"
	MH_retreat = "Trigger Enemy: escapes on a predictive arc while enemies are on radar, then returns to the offload target. Trigger Damage: retreats when the hull value drops below the threshold and stays home until it recovers. Optional repair when safe (emergency)."
	MH_support = "Repair rendezvous and construction assistance (phase 3)."
	MH_trade = "Sells surplus allowed by the Sell column (Profiles, Surplus) to a discovered station of this sector at its current price; with travel off (warehouse) only to a station already in transfer range. A station that refuses or takes nothing is skipped for the cooldown. Never buys."
